# DataGrid Server Query Codec Plan

## Contract Boundary

Server query codec belongs to `@affino/datagrid-server-adapters`.

It is a boundary helper between DataGrid row-model pull requests and backend HTTP/query DTOs. It must not change core projection, sort, filter, group, pivot, or pagination semantics.

The codec normalizes DataGrid request data into a stable JSON-safe backend DTO. It is not a SQL compiler, ORM adapter, permissions engine, or backend execution layer.

`@affino/datagrid-server-client` remains a transport package. It serializes request bodies and parses responses, but it must not interpret DataGrid filter semantics or special-case quick filter, advanced filter, grouping, or pagination behavior.

Backends can either:

- accept the raw DataGrid protocol and ignore this codec;
- use the normalized DTO as a production default;
- override codec output with package-level mapping hooks when their API shape differs.

